    },
    {
      "id": "claim_61e091417cb34fadaa2f603efe126030",
      "statement": "HMS exposes EP-HMS-01 (GET /prsp/hms/v1/holds?paymentId=, callable by IWB and PPH's legacy sync, returning hrcCode, category, description, analystNotes, slaDueTs) and EP-HMS-02 (POST /prsp/hms/v1/holds/{holdId}/disposition, IWB only, requiring HOLD_RELEASER role and maker-checker CTRL-PAY-012); there is currently no client-facing interface, and proposal FCT-1893 (Client-Safe Hold Status Facade) was deprioritized in 2025-Q3.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/prsp-hms-3.4-hold-management-service-design-and-reason-taxonomy-restricted.md#L80-L88",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2106f98fbd574b8cd510cc5d07e5757a1f9796e1bc661d226e4ad0ba71f20559:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4e318a17736c47ec9c4fa6d3acf250e2",
      "statement": "HMS enforces four controls verbatim: CTRL-PAY-012 (maker-checker release/reject by HOLD_RELEASER role), CTRL-PAY-018 (HRC-02 callback verification must use an independently-obtained phone contact, not channel-based confirmation), CTRL-PAY-031 (HRC-01-only digital attestation with step-up auth, capped at $5,000,000, introduced 2026-06 after pilot FCT-1951), and CTRL-PAY-040 (no client-facing release-time estimate for tier G or R holds).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/prsp-hms-3.4-hold-management-service-design-and-reason-taxonomy-restricted.md#L90-L97",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1e2534c9ba23d6c0d8aad78f1b4e1c584e504adade490ac3ee8a66fdfaf9967b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_304a78a9fc8c406d9c25d61a9e77e970",
      "statement": "Where a payment is blocked or rejected for sanctions reasons, Sanctions Operations notifies the client in writing per the Sanctions Operations Procedure and reports to OFAC (blocked: 31 CFR 501.603; rejected: 31 CFR 501.604); channels must not communicate screening outcomes.",
